se model is a decision tree with a minimum leaf size is 5, and the minimum split size is 5. The optimum depth for this model is determined by optimizing the F1-score using 10-fold cross-validation.","topics":[],"score":288990,"global_rank":27969},{"name":"d-diaz/refit_fvs","owner":"d-diaz","html_url":"https://github.com/d-diaz/refit_fvs","stars":5,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":288980,"global_rank":27973},{"name":"baumanab/BayAreaBikeShare","owner":"baumanab","html_url":"https://github.com/baumanab/BayAreaBikeShare","stars":2,"forks":11,"watchers":2,"issues":1,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Udacity Bay Area Bike Share Project","topics":[],"score":288973,"global_rank":27976},{"name":"allenai/covid-sim","owner":"allenai","html_url":"https://github.com/allenai/covid-sim","stars":5,"forks":2,"watchers":1,"issues":19,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":288956,"global_rank":27986},{"name":"shobhitm23/wolfAI","owner":"shobhitm23","html_url":"https://github.com/shobhitm23/wolfAI","stars":1,"forks":3,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"WolfAI, your path to sales conversions","topics":[],"score":288946,"global_rank":27991},{"name":"ai2cm/nudge-to-obs-manuscript-workflow","owner":"ai2cm","html_url":"https://github.com/ai2cm/nudge-to-obs-manuscript-workflow","stars":3,"forks":0,"watchers":7,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Code for \"Correcting weather and climate models by machine learning nudged historical simulations\"","topics":[],"score":288938,"global_rank":27998},{"name":"jimit105/CSE-534---Project","owner":"jimit105","html_url":"https://github.com/jimit105/CSE-534---Project","stars":3,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Automated Website Fingerprinting using Deep Learning (Project for CSE 534 - Fundamentals of Computer Networks)","topics":["deep-learning",